msgctxt "108"
msgid "(This shisa looks a lot like the one in that couple's photo.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "(Better give those two a call.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"(Hmm... This might not be the right one, though. Maybe I'll hold off for "
"now.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Hey. I'm the one you gave the shisa photo to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Huh? You mean you've actually been looking for it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Yeah, and I found one that looks just like it. Can you come check it out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Yes, absolutely! We'll be right there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "So, you say you've found the shisa in the photo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Yeah. Over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Oh, my goodness! That's it! That's the one, all right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"No, wait... It's a little different. Compare it to the\r\n"
"photo. See now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Oh, you're right. It is different."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "So that's not it, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"No, but don't worry. Shisa statues can often look alike.\r\n"
"If you do find the one in the photo, please give us a call."
msgstr ""

